Description: Quranic Ruqya player
 Plays ayah-by-ayah recitations with Arabic text, translations and
 word-by-word breakdown. Playlist audio, word timings, and translations
 are bundled per-playlist under <playlist>_data/; no network required
 at runtime. Built with PySide6 and Qt Quick.